    "description": "## Objective\n\nTurn the sample-load transform into a documented, repeatable production migration for the Agency-side data.\n\n## Implementation Requirements\n\n* Request the Agency-side rates/links files from the client\n* Codify transforms: multi-vertical row splits, vertical value mapping, market value mapping, brand-to-Operator derivation with alias entries, error-row cleansing, monthly-rate-to-Deal-Version strategy\n* Document the SAMPLE-record purge step\n* Dry-run with reconciliation report\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n* Dry-run accounts for 100% of source rows (loaded or excluded with reason)\n\n## Testing Notes\n\nReconciliation report.\n\n## Open Questions\n\n* Deal Version strategy for monthly rate changes — pending the client's answer on rate history reporting (see POC-06 open question).\n\n---\n\nEstimate: M · \\~12h · Dependencies: POC-11, Agency-side data file from client · Ticket BUILD-07 (approved 2026-07-04)",
